000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. RRDSNATL.
000300*    RRDSLODS, written against native VSAM instead of VSAMIO.
000400 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000500 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000600 FILE-CONTROL.
000700     SELECT RECORD-IMAGES ASSIGN TO DA-2314-S-IMAGES.
000800     SELECT RRDS-FILE ASSIGN TO RRDSF01
000900         ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
001000         ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
001100         FILE STATUS IS WS-STATUS.
001200 DATA DIVISION.
001300 FILE SECTION.
001400 FD  RECORD-IMAGES
001500     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
001600     BLOCK CONTAINS 10 RECORDS.
001700 01  RECORD-IMAGE                PIC X(80).
001800 FD  RRDS-FILE
001900     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
002000     RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS.
002100 01  RRDS-RECORD                 PIC X(80).
002200 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002300 01  WS-STATUS                   PIC X(2)  VALUE '00'.
002400 01  END-OF-FILE-SWITCH          PIC X(1)  VALUE 'N'.
002500     88  END-OF-FILE                       VALUE 'Y'.
002600 01  WRITE-FAILED-SWITCH         PIC X(1)  VALUE 'N'.
002700     88  WRITE-FAILED                      VALUE 'Y'.
002800 01  RECORD-COUNTER              PIC S9(8) VALUE +0.
002900 01  COUNTER-EDIT                PIC  ZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.
003000 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
003100 000-INITIATE.
003200     DISPLAY 'RRDSLODS: WRITE RRDS SEQUENTIALLY'.
003300     DISPLAY '---------------------------------'.
003400     DISPLAY ' '.
003500     OPEN INPUT RECORD-IMAGES.
003600     OPEN OUTPUT RRDS-FILE.
003700     IF WS-STATUS NOT = '00'
003800         DISPLAY 'VSAM ERROR DURING OPEN, STATUS ' WS-STATUS
003900         MOVE 'Y' TO END-OF-FILE-SWITCH.
004000 010-PROCESS.
004100     PERFORM 110-PROCESS-DATA THRU 119-EXIT UNTIL END-OF-FILE.
004200 020-TERMINATE.
004300     CLOSE RECORD-IMAGES.
004400     CLOSE RRDS-FILE.
004500     MOVE RECORD-COUNTER TO COUNTER-EDIT.
004600     DISPLAY COUNTER-EDIT ' RECORDS WERE LOADED SUCCESSFULLY'.
004700     STOP RUN.
004800 110-PROCESS-DATA.
004900     READ RECORD-IMAGES
005000         AT END MOVE 'Y' TO END-OF-FILE-SWITCH.
005100     IF NOT END-OF-FILE
005200         PERFORM 120-ADD-RECORD THRU 129-EXIT.
005300 119-EXIT.
005400     EXIT.
005500 120-ADD-RECORD.
005600     MOVE RECORD-IMAGE TO RRDS-RECORD.
005700     MOVE 'N' TO WRITE-FAILED-SWITCH.
005800     WRITE RRDS-RECORD
005900         INVALID KEY MOVE 'Y' TO WRITE-FAILED-SWITCH.
006000     IF NOT WRITE-FAILED
006100         ADD +1 TO RECORD-COUNTER.
006200     IF WRITE-FAILED
006300         DISPLAY 'VSAM ERROR ON WRITE, STATUS ' WS-STATUS
006400         MOVE 'Y' TO END-OF-FILE-SWITCH.
006500 129-EXIT.
006600     EXIT.
